--- Passing Function as Argument ---
apply_fn(inc, 10): 11
apply_fn(mult, 10): 30
--- Higher-Order Map / Filter ---
mapped len: 5
mapped[0]: 2
mapped[4]: 6
filtered len: 3
filtered[0]: 1
filtered[1]: 3
filtered[2]: 5
--- Functions Stored in Array & Dictionary ---
f0(5): 6
f1(5): 15
f_step(20): 21
f_scale(20): 60
--- Returning Function from Factory ---
op(100): 101
--- Builtin Functions as Parameters ---
apply_fn(upper, 'hello'): HELLO
apply_fn(lower, 'WORLD'): world
